    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9001" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">col-lăbĕfacto</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conl-</span></b> ),
			āre, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to make to reel</i>, <i>shake</i>, or <i>totter</i> (perh.
			only in the two foll. exs.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">motu collabefactat onus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					1, 566</span></i>
			.—<b>Poet.</b> of liquefying
			metals: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rigorem auri,</span>”
				<i>to overpower</i>, <i>subdue</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					1, 493</span></i>
			; cf. collabefio.</div>
